                                "sense_id": "e445b25c-6962-3d14-957e-77b80c64dffa",
                                "text": "The only abrasivenesses in her stories are the ones she deliberately puts there to be smoothed away as her fictional children progress towards the desired conclusion – so that she can begin another story and do the same thing all over again."
